<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures do not trade.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures do not trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures did not trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There's very little happening here. We're just trying to get some liquidity in the market,&quot; Chris Gray of C, A &amp; L Bell Commodities Corp Pty Ltd said.</p>
<p>November 1997 and January 1998, the two tightest months, seemed likely to generate some action in the next couple of weeks, he said.</p>
<p>Settlement prices, the mid-point between bid and ask quotes, generally dropped back by A$2.00-A$3.00 a tonne on Thursday.  </p>
